{"id": "X-TRB-001", "verdict": "corrected", "corrected_text": "In both our build and the release Agello ships (agello-one-20261115), when the tf_lite_per_layer_embedder section fails to map, LitertLmLoader::GetSectionBuffer logs 'Failed to map section' and returns nullopt, ModelResourcesLitertLm::GetTFLiteModel returns NotFound for the empty buffer, and InitializeEmbeddingLookups creates the per-layer lookup only when that model is found, so engine creation succeeds without it; every later prefill of an E2B or E4B file then looks for per-layer embeddings in the inputs and fails with NotFound 'No per-layer embeddings found in inputs.'. Agello (93122b647a) validates each new engine with a one-token reply on a throwaway conversation and, when that validation fails, retries the same configuration once after 750 ms.", "corrected_sources": [{"type": "code", "repo": "litert-lm", "sha": "df6df5b84d5845b49889f631ed4cac80b4325dd3", "pin": "b7b856a0cf7e2304f556e985218bc698768233f7", "path": "runtime/util/litert_lm_loader.cc", "lines": [404, 410], "symbol": null, "lines_sha1": "1a489636c205dd080097e43a14c0c2a3673cb11b", "url": "https://github.com/google-ai-edge/LiteRT-LM/blob/df6df5b84d5845b49889f631ed4cac80b4325dd3/runtime/util/litert_lm_loader.cc#L404-L410"}, {"type": "code", "repo": "litert-lm", "sha": "df6df5b84d5845b49889f631ed4cac80b4325dd3", "pin": "b7b856a0cf7e2304f556e985218bc698768233f7", "path": "runtime/util/litert_lm_loader.cc", "lines": [479, 489], "symbol": null, "lines_sha1": "011d722f5d53644d150e78d72d638dd65321906a", "url": "https://github.com/google-ai-edge/LiteRT-LM/blob/df6df5b84d5845b49889f631ed4cac80b4325dd3/runtime/util/litert_lm_loader.cc#L479-L489"}, {"type": "code", "repo": "litert-lm", "sha": "df6df5b84d5845b49889f631ed4cac80b4325dd3", "pin": "b7b856a0cf7e2304f556e985218bc698768233f7", "path": "runtime/components/model_resources_litert_lm.cc", "lines": [128, 136], "symbol": null, "lines_sha1": "3838080c5593baf4df51b5b870989156c72aab03", "url": "https