{"id": "X-TRB-003", "verdict": "corrected", "corrected_text": "In our build, once a Conversation's decode has ended kMaxNumTokensReached (a full KV cache) and its final callback has returned, the next message's prefill task is created in kMaxNumTokensReached (ThreadedExecutionManager::CreateTask) and never runs; the prefill callback of Conversation::SendMessageAsync passes that end state to the internal callback, which, with return_error_on_max_tokens_reached false (the Builder default), handles kMaxNumTokensReached like kDone and completes the send with the accumulated (empty) reply and no error.", "corrected_sources": [{"type": "code", "repo": "litert-lm", "sha": "b7b856a0cf7e2304f556e985218bc698768233f7", "pin": "b7b856a0cf7e2304f556e985218bc698768233f7", "path": "runtime/framework/resource_management/threaded_execution_manager.cc", "lines": [307, 327], "symbol": null, "lines_sha1": "de631ac092b8b11a61ea22c006cda8cfb11df195", "url": "https://github.com/PowerBeef/agello-litert-lm/blob/b7b856a0cf7e2304f556e985218bc698768233f7/runtime/framework/resource_management/threaded_execution_manager.cc#L307-L327"}, {"type": "code", "repo": "litert-lm", "sha": "b7b856a0cf7e2304f556e985218bc698768233f7", "pin": "b7b856a0cf7e2304f556e985218bc698768233f7", "path": "runtime/conversation/conversation.cc", "lines": [847, 869], "symbol": null, "lines_sha1": "6fe40ed2c84362d72ef7283ba25303b028bab408", "url": "https://github.com/PowerBeef/agello-litert-lm/blob/b7b856a0cf7e2304f556e985218bc698768233f7/runtime/conversation/conversation.cc#L847-L869"}, {"type": "code", "repo": "litert-lm", "sha": "df6df5b84d5845b49889f631ed4cac80b4325dd3", "pin": "b7b856a0cf7e2304f556e985218bc698768233f7", "path": "runtime/conversation/internal_callback_util.cc", "lines": [318, 343], "symbol": null, "lines_sha1": "708fa45cbf47717e419ee16b91c7d5a4a0dddd85", "url": "https://github.com/google-ai-edge/LiteRT-LM/blob/df6df5b84d5845b49889f631ed4cac80b4325dd3/runtime/conversation/internal_callback_util.cc#L318-