{"id": "X-TRB-004", "verdict": "corrected", "corrected_text": "In our build, Conversation::Create prefills the preface only when prefill_preface_on_init is set (Builder default false), and Conversation::GetTokenCount returns the session's current step, so a new conversation created through the C API or Swift wrapper reports 0 tokens until its first message is prefilled, whatever system message or prior messages it was given.", "corrected_sources": [{"type": "code", "repo": "litert-lm", "sha": "b7b856a0cf7e2304f556e985218bc698768233f7", "pin": "b7b856a0cf7e2304f556e985218bc698768233f7", "path": "runtime/conversation/conversation.cc", "lines": [442, 443], "symbol": null, "lines_sha1": "17bdc95b6d32621b89ac1441d38ecba9c09d67a9", "url": "https://github.com/PowerBeef/agello-litert-lm/blob/b7b856a0cf7e2304f556e985218bc698768233f7/runtime/conversation/conversation.cc#L442-L443"}, {"type": "code", "repo": "litert-lm", "sha": "b7b856a0cf7e2304f556e985218bc698768233f7", "pin": "b7b856a0cf7e2304f556e985218bc698768233f7", "path": "runtime/conversation/conversation.cc", "lines": [936, 938], "symbol": null, "lines_sha1": "59d055055fd82367f350a360884ae1b6f46697cb", "url": "https://github.com/PowerBeef/agello-litert-lm/blob/b7b856a0cf7e2304f556e985218bc698768233f7/runtime/conversation/conversation.cc#L936-L938"}, {"type": "code", "repo": "litert-lm", "sha": "b7b856a0cf7e2304f556e985218bc698768233f7", "pin": "b7b856a0cf7e2304f556e985218bc698768233f7", "path": "runtime/conversation/conversation.h", "lines": [274, 274], "symbol": null, "lines_sha1": "6a6cb234eb357dde44ce040bd0d893a55534bf33", "url": "https://github.com/PowerBeef/agello-litert-lm/blob/b7b856a0cf7e2304f556e985218bc698768233f7/runtime/conversation/conversation.h#L274"}], "note": "Re-pin 2026-11-17: conversation.cc:442-443, 936-938 and conversation.h:274 already at b7b856a0. Code holds; 'agello-next' -> our build."}
{"id": "X-TRB-005", "verdict": "corrected", "corrected_text": "In our build, after a Conversation's task is cancelled and its final callback has returned, the next message's prefill task is created kDependentTaskCancelled and never runs; Conversation::SendMessageAsync passes that end state to the internal callback, which reports kDependentTaskCancelled exactly like kCancelled, as absl::CancelledError('Task cancelled'), and the C conversation stream turns it into a final chunk whose error is 'CANCELLED: Task cancelled'.", "corrected_sources": [{"type": "code", "repo": "litert-lm", "sha": "b7b856a0cf7e2304f556e985218bc698768233f7", "pin": "b7b856a0cf7e2304f556e985218bc698768233f7", "path": "runtime/framework/resource_management/threaded_execution_manager.cc", "lines": [307, 327], "symbol": null, "lines_sha1": "de631ac092b8b11a61ea22c006cda8cfb11df195", "url": "https://github.com/PowerBeef/agello-litert-lm/blob/b7b856a0cf7e2304f556e985218bc698768233f7/runtime/framework/resource_management/threaded_execution_manager.cc#L307-L327"}, {"type": "code", "repo": "litert-lm", "sha": "b7b856a0cf7e2304f556e985218bc698768233f7", "pin": "b7b856a0cf7e2304f556e985218bc698768233f7", "path": "runtime/conversation/conversation.cc", "lines": [847, 869], "symbol": null, "lines_sha1": "6fe40ed2c84362d72ef7283ba25303b028bab408", "url": "https://github.com/PowerBeef/agello-litert-lm/blob/b7b856a0cf7e2304f556e985218bc698768233f7/runtime/conversation/conversation.cc#L847-L869"}, {"type": "code", "repo": "litert-lm", "sha": "df6df5b84d5845b49889f631ed4cac80b4325dd3", "pin": "b7b856a0cf7e2304f556e985218bc698768233f7", "path": "runtime/conversation/internal_callback_util.cc", "lines": [302, 308], "symbol": null, "lines_sha1": "7590c3c242b901e39c07f0c3e3ba808fcf8caa51", "url": "https://github.com/google-ai-edge/LiteRT-LM/blob/df6df5b84d5845b49889f631ed4cac80b4325dd3/runtime/conversation/internal_callback_util.cc#L302-L308"}, {"type": "code", "repo": "litert-lm", "sha": "b7b856a0cf7e2304f556e98521